flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read number of items/]
    B --> C{n > 0?}
    C -- No --> D[Display error]
    C -- Yes --> E[Read and validate each item]
    E --> F{All entries valid?}
    F -- No --> G[Display validation error]
    F -- Yes --> H[Calculate each line amount]
    H --> I[Add and display total bill]
    D --> J([End])
    G --> J
    I --> J
